<title>NETHERLANDS: Athlon finalises French takeover.</title>
<headline>Athlon finalises French takeover.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automobile firm Athlon Groep NV said on Thursday it had finalised the takeover of French car rental and lease company Financieres G.G. Jean Jaures which was announced earlier this month.</p>
<p>Athlon repeated it expected the takeover to contribute immediately to its profits.</p>
<p>Jean Jaures posts annual turnover of 230 million French francs and has more than 90 employees. Athlon said earlier this month it would finance the acquisition through subordinated loans but gave no further financial details of the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
